From 00f6aa6de372e6b26620da3dfb378b6a8924f143 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 21:52:44 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed quick settings sidebar

The gear button of the player's control bar now opens a quick settings sidebar on the right instead of the Adjustments and Effects window, so changes can be made while the video keeps playing next to it. It has Playback (speed with preset steps), Video (track, zoom, aspect ratio, crop, fit, deinterlacing, stereo mode), Audio (track, stereo mode, delay, equalizer preset) and Subtitles (track, delay, appearance) tabs, each ending with a link to the full settings or the effects window.

SettingsRow gets an adjustable control width for the narrow sidebar, and its slider gets an explicit width and a track color visible on both backgrounds.
---
 modules/gui/qt/Makefile.am                    |   1 +
 .../qt/dialogs/dialogs/qml/SettingsRow.qml    |   8 +-
 modules/gui/qt/meson.build                    |   1 +
 modules/gui/qt/player/qml/Player.qml          |  30 +-
 .../gui/qt/player/qml/QuickSettingsPanel.qml  | 593 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../ExtendedSettingsButton.qml                |  15 +-
 6 files changed, 643 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 modules/gui/qt/player/qml/QuickSettingsPanel.qml

